shortdesc Numbering text
longdesc The package offers facilities for adding a columns of numbering
longdesc to the general text so that the text can be properly
longdesc referenced. The vertical ruler can be scaled and moved freely.
longdesc The package may be used either with LaTeX or with plain TeX.
